 "nl": [
  "student-lab may use any TCP port towards research, except FTP (TCP 21), Telnet (TCP 23), which must be blocked.",
  "finance is isolated: it may only reach guest-wifi on DNS over UDP 53; edge-cache on NTP (UDP 123), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach hr over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "Allow mail to connect to dev-lab using LDAP (TCP 389) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Hosts in hr may reach edge-cache over IMAP (TCP 143) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "research offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Apart from engineering on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in vpn-users must be dropped."
 ],
